{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2023-01-23 15:35:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN COMPANY TO BECOME OFFICIAL DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION PARTNER OF THE AJGA', 'text': 'THE PARTNERSHIP AIMS TO ADVANCE THE AJGA DEI PLATFORMS AND FURTHER CLOSE DIVERSITY GAPS. ATLANTA , JAN. 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN COMPANY AND THE AMERICAN JUNIOR GOLF ASSOCIATION (AJGA) ARE PROUD TO ANNOUNCE SOUTHERN COMPANY AS THE OFFICIAL DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION PARTNER OF THE AJGA.'}